# #133 Shadow Hunter's native check by parity: Hex refuses b's attacks, grabs and specials while b
# mashes, which shortens it but never below its floor; immunity and a shield stop the next Hex; a hexed
# b still jumps and uses up special; exhausted mana refuses the final Hex; Spirit Glaive hits b
# after its dodge ends. Shadow Hunter a against Shadow Hunter b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero shadow hunter
# Both dash in, close.
40 a stick 1 0
40 b stick -1 0
42 a stick 0 0
42 b stick 0 0
# Hex on b; b mashes attack every 4 frames, with a grab and a neutral special between: all refused until the floor.
60 a stick 0 -1
60 a tap X 2
61 a stick 0 0
90 b tap A 2
92 b tap RB 2
94 b tap A 2
98 b tap A 2
100 b tap X 2
102 b shield 1
103 b capture
104 b shield 0
105 b press LB
105 b stick 1 0
106 b tap A 2
107 b capture
108 b stick 0 0
109 b release LB
110 b tap X 2
114 b tap RB 2
118 b tap A 2
122 b tap A 2
126 b tap A 2
130 b tap A 2
# Immune: the next Hex strikes b, and b attacks at once.
200 a stick 0 -1
200 a tap X 2
201 a stick 0 0
234 b tap A 2
238 b tap A 2
242 b tap A 2
246 b tap A 2
250 b tap A 2
254 b tap A 2
# b's held shield stops a Hex.
290 b shield 1
290 a stick 0 -1
290 a tap X 2
291 a stick 0 0
360 b shield 0
# Hex once immunity is over: b still jumps and uses up special.
400 a stick 0 -1
400 a tap X 2
401 a stick 0 0
446 b tap B 8
452 b stick 0 1
452 b tap X 2
453 b stick 0 0
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
# b dashes away from a, once it has landed.
530 b stick 1 0
532 b stick 0 0
570 a release VIEW
# Spirit Glaive: b's dodge protects frames 663-676; the outgoing 6% hit lands at 677,
# before the projectile's return at age 22 (frame 679).
640 a tap X 2
661 b shield 1
662 b stick 0 -1
663 b stick 0 0
665 b shield 0
# Four 25-mana Hexes and the 1/sec floor leave 7 mana: the final Hex is refused.
# b waits until the same original attack frame.
700 a stick 0 -1
700 a tap X 2
701 a stick 0 0
793 b tap A 2
