#! expect b 88 damage 2.000
#! absent b 89-125 applied attack
#! absent b 89-125 special
#! absent b 89-125 grab-hold
#! expect b 126 applied attack 1 style 0
#! expect a 200 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 231 damage 4.000
#! expect b 241 applied attack 3 style 0
#! expect a 290 special 16 form 0
#! absent b 291-433 damage
#! expect a 400 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 434 damage 6.000
#! expect b 449 applied jump 1 double 0
#! expect b 452 special 15 form 0
#! expect a 640 special 13 form 0
#! absent b 641-676 damage
#! expect b 677 damage 12.000
#! absent a 700-701 special
#! absent b 700-792 damage
#! absent b 739-792 applied attack
#! expect b 793 applied attack 6 style 0
#! scene a PolymorphTarget
#! scene a ShadowHunterMissile
#! scene a WitchDoctorMissile
#! scene a ShieldP2
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
